// src/Central/FindingText.php, row 334
"Fine when it reads a public address the app needs (a feed, an image or a page of its own site). Do not install it when it points to a local path (../, /etc/, file://), to an internal address (localhost, 10.x, 192.168.x) or when the address is built from what a visitor sends (URL parameters)." => "U redu je ako čita javnu adresu koju aplikacija treba (feed, sliku ili stranicu vlastitog weba). Nemojte je instalirati ako vodi na lokalnu putanju (../, /etc/, file://), na unutarnju adresu (localhost, 10.x, 192.168.x) ili ako se adresa sastavlja od onoga što šalje posjetitelj (parametri URL-a).", // ai 2026-10

// src/Central/FindingText.php, row 335
